# New Worlds Await (jeuno 133), the level either side of 75 (playerLevel == 75), each a Warrior with the Limit Breaker at
# cap 75 (level 75 is the main flow's): level 74 (main): 10045 (74, 1, 0, 0); level 76 (c76): 10045 (76, 1, 0, 0). The
# available check reads no level: both get the section.
lists RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10045
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=10.0,1.5,119.9 job=WAR lvl=74
char c76 zone=RuludeGardens pos=10.0,1.5,119.9 job=WAR lvl=76
keyitem LimitBreaker
levelcap 75
c76: keyitem LimitBreaker
c76: levelcap 75
login
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # level 74: 10045 (74, 1, 0, 0)
finish option=0
c76: login
c76: trigger Nomad_Moogle               # level 76: 10045 (76, 1, 0, 0)
c76: finish option=0
